    user_response: "Build a complaint submission page for SAGE with the following fields:\n- Category dropdown (Infrastructure, Mess/Food, Harassment, WiFi/Internet, Hygiene, Other)\n- Description textarea (min 20 characters, max 1000 characters, show live character count)\n- Hostel/Location dropdown or text input\n- Optional photo upload (max 5MB, jpg/png only)\n- Submit button\n\nOn submit:\n- Generate a random public complaint ID in the format SAGE-XXXX\n- Show a confirmation screen with the complaint ID and a message explaining \n  \"Your identity is not visible to anyone during normal review. You can track \n  this complaint using your ID.\"\n- Do NOT show the student\'s name or email anywhere after this point in the app\n\nStyle: clean, minimal, calming color palette (blues/whites), mobile responsive."
    items {
      text: "Build a complaint submission page for SAGE with the following fields:\n- Category dropdown (Infrastructure, Mess/Food, Harassment, WiFi/Internet, Hygiene, Other)\n- Description textarea (min 20 characters, max 1000 characters, show live character count)\n- Hostel/Location dropdown or text input\n- Optional photo upload (max 5MB, jpg/png only)\n- Submit button\n\nOn submit:\n- Generate a random public complaint ID in the format SAGE-XXXX\n- Show a confirmation screen with the complaint ID and a message explaining \n  \"Your identity is not visible to anyone during normal review. You can track \n  this complaint using your ID.\"\n- Do NOT show the student\'s name or email anywhere after this point in the app\n\nStyle: clean, minimal, calming color palette (blues/whites), mobile responsive."
    }
  }
