  planner_response {
    response: "I have built the complaint submission page and anonymous tracking experience for **S.A.G.E.** with a clean, calming blue-and-white aesthetic and mobile-responsive layout:\n\n### Key Features Implemented:\n- **Category Dropdown & Quick Select**: Includes all specified categories (**Infrastructure**, **Mess/Food**, **Harassment**, **WiFi/Internet**, **Hygiene**, and **Other**) with instant category selection.\n- **Description Field with Live Character Counter**: Real-time counter (`X / 1000 chars`), visual progress indicator, and validation ensuring entries meet the minimum 20-character and maximum 1,000-character requirement.\n- **Hostel / Location Selector**: Comprehensive dropdown for standard hostels and campus hubs alongside free-form text input for precise rooms, wings, or custom locations.\n- **Optional Photo Attachment**: Supports drag-and-drop and click-to-upload for **JPG and PNG images (up to 5MB)** with client-side file validation, image preview, and one-click removal.\n- **Anonymous ID Generation**: Generates public tracking IDs in the **`SAGE-XXXX`** format upon submission.\n- **Confirmation Screen**: Displays the generated tracking ID with a 1-click copy button, along with the required statement: *\"Your identity is not visible to anyone during normal review. You can track this complaint using your ID.\"*\n- **Strict Privacy & Anonymity**: No student name or email is collected, stored, or displayed anywhere in the application.\n- **Calming Visual Theme**: Designed with a palette of soft slates, crisp whites, and deep ocean blues with accessible contrast and responsive spacing."
    thinking: "**Verifying Requirements Compliance**\n\nI\'ve meticulously reviewed the user requirements. I\'ve confirmed the \"Category\" dropdown is present across the types, form, feed filters, and badges, as requested. Additionally, I\342\200\231ve established a minimum character count of 20 characters for the \"Description\" textarea. I\'m focusing on ensuring these fundamental elements are correctly implemented and meet specifications.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have built the complaint submission page and anonymous tracking experience for **S.A.G.E.** with a clean, calming blue-and-white aesthetic and mobile-responsive layout:\n\n### Key Features Implemented:\n- **Category Dropdown & Quick Select**: Includes all specified categories (**Infrastructure**, **Mess/Food**, **Harassment**, **WiFi/Internet**, **Hygiene**, and **Other**) with instant category selection.\n- **Description Field with Live Character Counter**: Real-time counter (`X / 1000 chars`), visual progress indicator, and validation ensuring entries meet the minimum 20-character and maximum 1,000-character requirement.\n- **Hostel / Location Selector**: Comprehensive dropdown for standard hostels and campus hubs alongside free-form text input for precise rooms, wings, or custom locations.\n- **Optional Photo Attachment**: Supports drag-and-drop and click-to-upload for **JPG and PNG images (up to 5MB)** with client-side file validation, image preview, and one-click removal.\n- **Anonymous ID Generation**: Generates public tracking IDs in the **`SAGE-XXXX`** format upon submission.\n- **Confirmation Screen**: Displays the generated tracking ID with a 1-click copy button, along with the required statement: *\"Your identity is not visible to anyone during normal review. You can track this complaint using your ID.\"*\n- **Strict Privacy & Anonymity**: No student name or email is collected, stored, or displayed anywhere in the application.\n- **Calming Visual Theme**: Designed with a palette of soft slates, crisp whites, and deep ocean blues with accessible contrast and responsive spacing."
    thinking_duration {
      nanos: 331630431
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
