t Evidence\'}\n            className=\"max-h-[70vh] w-auto max-w-full object-contain border border-[#FAF9F6]/20\"\n            referrerPolicy=\"no-referrer\"\n          />\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  );\n};\n"
