  planner_response {
    response: "I have built the complaint feed page and detail view for SAGE:\n\n### 1. Complaint Card Grid\n- **Complaint ID**: Prominently displayed (e.g., `SAGE-2847`) in high-contrast monospace formatting.\n- **Color-Coded Category Tags**: Specific badges for each grievance category (*Infrastructure*, *Mess/Food*, *Harassment*, *WiFi/Internet*, *Hygiene*, *Other*).\n- **Short Description Preview**: Clean multi-line statement excerpts with hover focus.\n- **Hostel / Location**: Displays the hostel block, room, wing, or campus area with map pin indicators.\n- **Color-Coded Status Badges**:\n  - **Yellow**: `Under Review`\n  - **Green**: `Resolved`\n  - **Red**: `High Priority` (for urgent student concerns)\n- **Upvote Button & Behavior**: Toggles to **\"Upvoted\"** with a checkmark, increments the count, and disables itself once clicked.\n\n### 2. Comprehensive Filtering & Sorting\n- **Filter by Category**: Quick-switch between all categories or specific departments.\n- **Filter by Status**: Filter by *Under Review (Yellow)*, *Resolved (Green)*, *High Priority (Red)*, or *Submitted*.\n- **Filter by Hostel / Area**: Filter grievances by specific hostel blocks or campus locations.\n- **Sort By**: Toggle between **\"Most Upvoted\"** and **\"Most Recent\"**.\n- **Search & Reset**: Real-time keyword filter across IDs, locations, and descriptions with one-click reset.\n\n### 3. Dedicated Complaint Detail Page\n- **Card Click Navigation**: Clicking any grievance card opens the full detail page.\n- **Full Statement & Metadata**: Displays complete un-truncated descriptions, exact timestamps, relative deposition dates, and anonymity protection verification.\n- **Evidence Viewer**: High-resolution image modal viewer for attached evidence.\n- **Status Lifecycle Pipeline**: 3-step escalation visualizer tracking the issue from Deposition to Review to Resolution.\n- **One-Click Actions**: Copy Complaint ID, endorse/upvote with disabled state handling, and return to the public ledger."
    modified_response: "I have built the complaint feed page and detail view for SAGE:\n\n### 1. Complaint Card Grid\n- **Complaint ID**: Prominently displayed (e.g., `SAGE-2847`) in high-contrast monospace formatting.\n- **Color-Coded Category Tags**: Specific badges for each grievance category (*Infrastructure*, *Mess/Food*, *Harassment*, *WiFi/Internet*, *Hygiene*, *Other*).\n- **Short Description Preview**: Clean multi-line statement excerpts with hover focus.\n- **Hostel / Location**: Displays the hostel block, room, wing, or campus area with map pin indicators.\n- **Color-Coded Status Badges**:\n  - **Yellow**: `Under Review`\n  - **Green**: `Resolved`\n  - **Red**: `High Priority` (for urgent student concerns)\n- **Upvote Button & Behavior**: Toggles to **\"Upvoted\"** with a checkmark, increments the count, and disables itself once clicked.\n\n### 2. Comprehensive Filtering & Sorting\n- **Filter by Category**: Quick-switch between all categories or specific departments.\n- **Filter by Status**: Filter by *Under Review (Yellow)*, *Resolved (Green)*, *High Priority (Red)*, or *Submitted*.\n- **Filter by Hostel / Area**: Filter grievances by specific hostel blocks or campus locations.\n- **Sort By**: Toggle between **\"Most Upvoted\"** and **\"Most Recent\"**.\n- **Search & Reset**: Real-time keyword filter across IDs, locations, and descriptions with one-click reset.\n\n### 3. Dedicated Complaint Detail Page\n- **Card Click Navigation**: Clicking any grievance card opens the full detail page.\n- **Full Statement & Metadata**: Displays complete un-truncated descriptions, exact timestamps, relative deposition dates, and anonymity protection verification.\n- **Evidence Viewer**: High-resolution image modal viewer for attached evidence.\n- **Status Lifecycle Pipeline**: 3-step escalation visualizer tracking the issue from Deposition to Review to Resolution.\n- **One-Click Actions**: Copy Complaint ID, endorse/upvote with disabled state handling, and return to the public ledger."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
