    items {
      text: "Build an admin dashboard UI that shows:\n- A table of all complaints with columns: Complaint ID, Category, Status, \n  Upvotes, Date Submitted, Location\n- Filter and search functionality\n- Click a row to open complaint detail with a status update dropdown \n  (submitted / under_review / resolved) and an optional resolution notes field\n- Analytics section at the top with: total complaints, complaints by category \n  (pie chart), complaints by hostel (bar chart), average resolution time\n\nUse a charting library like Recharts for the analytics visuals. Do not include \nany identity-related buttons or features on this dashboard."
