  planner_response {
    response: "I have built and integrated the **Admin Dashboard UI** for SAGE:\n\n### 1. Analytics & Operational Telemetry\n- **Recharts Data Visualizations**:\n  - **Complaints by Category (Pie Chart)**: High-contrast category distribution visualizer showing proportional breakdown (*Infrastructure, Mess/Food, Harassment, WiFi/Internet, Hygiene, Other*) with custom tooltips and legend.\n  - **Complaints by Hostel & Location (Bar Chart)**: Hotspot analysis showing volume per residence hall (*Block A, Block B, Block C, Girls H-1, Girls H-2, Mess Hall, Library, Academic Complex, Gate/Grounds*).\n- **Core KPI Metrics**:\n  - **Total Complaints**: Real-time counter with active investigation and submitted breakdowns.\n  - **Average Resolution Time**: Estimated average turnaround metric (hours) alongside percentage clearance rate.\n  - **Under Review & Urgent Concerns**: Quick-status counters for ongoing investigations and high-priority flags.\n\n### 2. Deposition Master Register (Table View)\n- **Table Columns**:\n  1. `Complaint ID` (e.g., `SAGE-2847`)\n  2. `Category` (styled badge)\n  3. `Status` (color-coded badges for *Submitted*, *Under Review*, *Resolved*, and *Urgent Priority*)\n  4. `Upvotes` (student endorsement count)\n  5. `Date Submitted` (exact calendar date & relative time elapsed)\n  6. `Location` (hostel/campus zone)\n  7. `Action` (Review & Update shortcut)\n- **Filter & Search Controls**:\n  - Real-time search across ID, description, location, and resolution notes.\n  - Dropdown filters for Category, Status, and Hostel/Area.\n  - Sorting options: *Newest First*, *Most Upvotes*, and *ID Ascending*.\n  - One-click filter reset.\n\n### 3. Row-Click Administrative Disposition Modal\n- **Complaint Inspection**: Displays full un-truncated statement of grievance, location, timestamp, upvotes, and photographic evidence with high-resolution zoom viewer.\n- **Status Update Dropdown**: Interactive selector with options for `Submitted`, `Under Review`, and `Resolved`.\n- **Optional Resolution Notes**: Textarea for administrative remarks (dispatch logs, work order IDs, contractor notes) that persist to the ledger and display on student deposition records.\n- **Strict Anonymity Preservation**: Contains zero identity-related buttons or reveal mechanisms, preserving 100% cryptographic anonymity."
    modified_response: "I have built and integrated the **Admin Dashboard UI** for SAGE:\n\n### 1. Analytics & Operational Telemetry\n- **Recharts Data Visualizations**:\n  - **Complaints by Category (Pie Chart)**: High-contrast category distribution visualizer showing proportional breakdown (*Infrastructure, Mess/Food, Harassment, WiFi/Internet, Hygiene, Other*) with custom tooltips and legend.\n  - **Complaints by Hostel & Location (Bar Chart)**: Hotspot analysis showing volume per residence hall (*Block A, Block B, Block C, Girls H-1, Girls H-2, Mess Hall, Library, Academic Complex, Gate/Grounds*).\n- **Core KPI Metrics**:\n  - **Total Complaints**: Real-time counter with active investigation and submitted breakdowns.\n  - **Average Resolution Time**: Estimated average turnaround metric (hours) alongside percentage clearance rate.\n  - **Under Review & Urgent Concerns**: Quick-status counters for ongoing investigations and high-priority flags.\n\n### 2. Deposition Master Register (Table View)\n- **Table Columns**:\n  1. `Complaint ID` (e.g., `SAGE-2847`)\n  2. `Category` (styled badge)\n  3. `Status` (color-coded badges for *Submitted*, *Under Review*, *Resolved*, and *Urgent Priority*)\n  4. `Upvotes` (student endorsement count)\n  5. `Date Submitted` (exact calendar date & relative time elapsed)\n  6. `Location` (hostel/campus zone)\n  7. `Action` (Review & Update shortcut)\n- **Filter & Search Controls**:\n  - Real-time search across ID, description, location, and resolution notes.\n  - Dropdown filters for Category, Status, and Hostel/Area.\n  - Sorting options: *Newest First*, *Most Upvotes*, and *ID Ascending*.\n  - One-click filter reset.\n\n### 3. Row-Click Administrative Disposition Modal\n- **Complaint Inspection**: Displays full un-truncated statement of grievance, location, timestamp, upvotes, and photographic evidence with high-resolution zoom viewer.\n- **Status Update Dropdown**: Interactive selector with options for `Submitted`, `Under Review`, and `Resolved`.\n- **Optional Resolution Notes**: Textarea for administrative remarks (dispatch logs, work order IDs, contractor notes) that persist to the ledger and display on student deposition records.\n- **Strict Anonymity Preservation**: Contains zero identity-related buttons or reveal mechanisms, preserving 100% cryptographic anonymity."
