        }
        lines {
          text: "      answer: \"Yes, 100%. S.A.G.E. is designed from the ground up to protect students from academic or personal retaliation. You do not log in, create an account, or provide your student email. We do not store your IP address, device fingerprints, or browser metadata with your grievance. When you submit a complaint, only the description, location, category, and optional photo are committed to the public ledger.\""
